ives `403 SCOPE_INSUFFICIENT`; a missing or invalid key receives `401`."},"5210":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions-66","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions#authentication-and-scopes","content":"The public endpoints for unsubscribe pages you host yourself (`POST /unsubscribe`, `POST /unsubscribe/one-click`) take the signed token from the unsubscribe link instead of an API key. See Unsubscribe links."},"5211":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions-67","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions#response-format","content":"Successful responses use the standard envelope:"},"5212":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions-68","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions#response-format","content":"Errors include the fix:"},"5213":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions-69","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions#response-format","content":"Validation errors use code `VALIDATION_ERROR` and name the offending field in `error.context.field`."},"5214":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions-70","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions#subscribe","content":"Create or update a contact, add it to lists, opt it into topics and record consent. With `doubleOptIn: true` NorthRelay emails a confirmation link and the contact stays `PENDING` until the recipient clicks it."},"5215":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions-71","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions#subscribe","content":"Returns `201` when the contact was created, `200` when it already existed. Repeating the same call is safe: nothing is added twice."},"5216":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/subscriptions