. NorthRelay automatically adds hard bounces to your suppression list."},"7000":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-117","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Use double opt-in.** Require email confirmation before adding contacts to your list."},"7001":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-118","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Validate emails at collection.** Use email syntax validation on signup forms."},"7002":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-119","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Remove inactive subscribers.** Contacts who have not engaged in 6+ months are more likely to become invalid."},"7003":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-120","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Only send to opted-in recipients.** Never purchase email lists."},"7004":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-121","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Include a visible unsubscribe link.** Make it easy to opt out -- this reduces complaints."},"7005":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-122","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Set expectations at signup.** Tell subscribers what content they will receive and how often."},"7006":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-123","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Honor unsubscribes immediately.** Process opt-outs within the same sending cycle."},"7007":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-124","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Segment your audience.** Send relevant content to each group rather than blasting everyone."},"7008":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-125","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check your DNS configuration.** Use the Pre-Flight Check to validate SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records."},"7009":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-126","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Verify your sending domain.** Unverified domains have lower trust with receivers."},"7010":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-127","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check the Blocklist Monitor.** Your IP or domain may be listed on a blocklist."},"7011":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-128","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Reduce sending volume temporarily.** If you are being throttled, slow down and gradually ramp back up."},"7012":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-129","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Check for new incidents.** The incidents panel will tell you which metric triggered the drop."},"7013":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-130","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Review recent sending activity.** Did you send to a new or untested list?"},"7014":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-131","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Check for infrastructure issues.** Use the Connectivity Doctor to verify SMTP connectivity."},"7015":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-132","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Warm up new domains gradually.** Start with small volumes (100-500/day) and increase over 2-4 weeks."},"7016":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-133","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Monitor your dashboard weekly.** Catch trends before they become incidents."},"7017":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-134","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Keep bounce rate under 2%.** This is the industry standard for healthy sending."},"7018":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-135","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Keep complaint rate under 0.08%.** Gmail's threshold for filtering is 0.1%."},"7019":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-136","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Segment by engagement.** Send more frequently to engaged contacts, less to inactive ones."},"7020":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-137","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Authenticate everything.** SPF, DKIM, and DMARC should all pass for every email."},"7021":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-138","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Diagnostic Tools for troubleshooting delivery issues"},"7022":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-139","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Domain Verification for setting up proper authentication"},"7023":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-140","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Sending Infrastructure for how NorthRelay protects its sending IP"},"7024":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-141","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Plans & Pricing for tier-specific reputation features"},"7025":{"id":"/docs/features/studio","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"page","content":"NorthRelay Studio","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio"},"7026":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-0","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio","content":"One place for email templates and brands — visual or HTML editing, versioned releases, brand previews, and the same templates from the dashboard, the API, SDKs, MCP and embedded apps"},"7027":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-1","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#northrelay-studio","content":"NorthRelay Studio"},"7028":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-2","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"What you get"},"7029":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-3","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Account templates and application templates"},"7030":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-4","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#sending-with-a-template","content":"Sending with a template"},"7031":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-5","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#from-code","content":"From code"},"7032":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-6","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"API surface"},"7033":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-7","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#installing-templates-into-another-account","content":"Installing templates into another account"},"7034":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-8","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#embedding-studio-in-your-product","content":"Embedding Studio in your product"},"7035":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-9","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#legacy-apis","content":"Legacy APIs"},"7036":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-10","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/studio#plans","content":"Plans"},"7037":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-11","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#northrelay-studio","content":"NorthRelay Studio is where your email **templates** and **brands** live. Every template, whether you build it in the dashboard, adopt it from the gallery or create it from code, is a versioned design: you edit a draft, review it, and publish an immutable release that sends use. Studio is included from the **Micro plan** ($12/mo)."},"7038":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-12","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#northrelay-studio","content":"Open it from the sidebar: **Studio** → Overview, Templates, Brands, Assets, Applications and Activity."},"7039":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-13","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Capability"},"7040":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-14","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"What it means for you"},"7041":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-15","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Templates**"},"7042":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-16","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Build visually with blocks or write HTML with Handlebars variables. Start blank or from the gallery (authentication, notifications, billing, marketing)."},"7043":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-17","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Brands**"},"7044":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-18","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Colours, logo, fonts, sender, compliance contact, footer, social links, custom variables and the unsubscribe page. Every template reads them as `{{theme.*}}`. Contrast checks warn when text would be hard to read."},"7045":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-19","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Preview**"},"7046":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-20","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Rendered by the same engine that sends: desktop, mobile, simulated dark mode and plain text, with sample data from the variable schema or your own values. Preview any template with another brand before you switch."},"7047":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-21","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Review & publish**"},"7048":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-22","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"A field-by-field diff against the live release before you publish. Drafts autosave and never affect live mail."},"7049":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-23","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Releases**"},"7050":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-24","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Each publish is an immutable snapshot. Restore any earlier release in one click."},"7051":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-25","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Usage**"},"7052":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-26","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"See which campaigns use a template and how many messages it sent, and which templates and campaigns use a brand."},"7053":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-27","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Deliveries**"},"7054":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-28","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Every send through a template, from the API or Studio, with its delivery events."},"7055":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-29","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Test sends**"},"7056":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-30","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Send yourself a test from a verified sender, safely retried with an idempotency key."},"7057":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-31","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Assets**"},"7058":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-32","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Upload a logo (PNG, JPEG or WebP up to 700 KiB). NorthRelay resizes it for email and serves it from an immutable HTTPS URL."},"7059":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-33","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"**Applications**"},"7060":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-34","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#what-you-get","content":"Products that send through NorthRelay (for example Alteriom Command Center) keep their own templates and brands under an application key, reached with a scoped `nr_app_` credential."},"7061":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-35","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Your own templates, the ones you create in the dashboard, belong to the reserved application **`account`**. Products can own templates under their own application key. The two differ in how they treat brands and variables:"},"7062":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-36","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Account templates (`account`)"},"7063":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-37","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Application templates (e.g. `command-center`)"},"7064":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-38","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Brand"},"7065":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-39","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Uses the bound brand **live**: edit the brand and the next send uses it."},"7066":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-40","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"The brand is **frozen in each release**. After a brand change, the brand editor lists the templates to publish again and can publish them for you."},"7067":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-41","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Variables"},"7068":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-42","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Lenient: a missing variable renders empty, extra variables are ignored."},"7069":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-43","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Strict: required variables must be present, unknown variables are refused."},"7070":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-44","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Sender"},"7071":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-45","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Optional on the template; the brand sender is the default, and a send can choose another verified sender."},"7072":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-46","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#account-templates-and-application-templates","content":"Must be one of the credential's allowed senders."},"7073":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-47","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#sending-with-a-template","content":"Use the template id with the email API. Nothing changes if you already send this way:"},"7074":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-48","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#sending-with-a-template","content":"The send uses the template's **live release**. A retired template is refused with `TEMPLATE_RETIRED`, a template that was never published with `TEMPLATE_NOT_PUBLISHED`, and missing required variables with `MISSING_TEMPLATE_VARIABLES`; each error names the fix."},"7075":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-49","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#sending-with-a-template","content":"Campaigns pick a template in the campaign wizard and render it with the contact's details, the brand and the unsubscribe links."},"7076":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-50","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#from-code","content":"Everything in Studio is available through `/api/v1/designs`, the SDKs and the MCP server."},"7077":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-51","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#from-code","content":"Every response is `{ success: true, data }` or `{ success: false, error: { code, message } }`. Writes carry `expectedRevision` (designs) or `expectedUpdatedAt` (brands), so two editors get a `409 REVISION_CONFLICT` instead of overwriting each other."},"7078":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-52","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"Method"},"7079":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-53","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"Path"},"7080":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-54","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"Purpose"},"7081":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-55","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"GET"},"7082":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-56","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"`/api/v1/capabilities`"},"7083":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-57","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"Permissions, application and sender restrictions, plan capacity"},"7084":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-58","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"GET, POST"},"7085":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-59","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"`/api/v1/designs`"},"7086":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-60","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"List templates (filters, cursor) / create a draft"},"7087":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-61","page_id":"/docs/features/studio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/studio#api-surface","content":"GET, PATCH, DELETE"},"7088":{"id":"/docs/features/studio-62","page_id":"/d