`previousSecretValidUntil`, one hour later. `events` is typed as `WebhookEventType[]`. See Webhook verification for the receiving side."},"9356":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-90","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#suppressions","content":"`reason` is one of `Bounce`, `Complaint`, `Unsubscribe` or `Manual`. To record a recipient's own opt-out, prefer `subscriptions.unsubscribe()`."},"9357":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-91","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#templates-and-brands-studio","content":"Every template is a Studio design. Your dashboard templates use the application key `\"account\"` (`ACCOUNT_APPLICATION`); a product with an `nr_app_` credential uses its own key."},"9358":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-92","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#templates-and-brands-studio","content":"`templates` and `brandTheme` are deprecated (sunset 30 April 2027). Template ids are design ids, so `emails.send({ templateId })` keeps working."},"9359":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-93","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"Property"},"9360":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-94","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"Methods"},"9361":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-95","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"`emails`"},"9362":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-96","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"`send`, `sendTemplate`, `schedule`, `cancel`, `validate`, `sendBatch`, `getEvents`"},"9363":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-97","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#other-resources","content":"`designs`